<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP SEMIFINAL SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP SEMIFINAL SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>BOLOGNA, Italy 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of an Italian Cup semifinal second leg match on Tuesday:</p>
<p>    Bologna	     1 - Scapolo 43</p>
<p>    Vicenza	     1 - Cornacchini 86</p>
<p>    HT: 1-0   Att: 20,000</p>
<p>Red card: Cardone (Bologna) 67</p>
<p>Vicenza win 2-1 on aggregate and play Internazionale or Napoli in the final.</p>
</text>
